        "address": 4294967296,
        "processor_ids": [
          "core0",
          "core1",
          "core2",
          "core3"
        ],
        "basis": "The stock firmware drains the second bus port with a discarded read at 0x100000000; helper 0x17f1794 names the port after 0x80000000 (D9)."
      },
